	<element name="Draconis Fundamentum, Young Dragon" type="Item" source="Fuller Adventures" id="ID_DRACONIS_FUNDAMENTUM">
		<description>
			<p>The draconis fundamentum is a gland possessed only by true dragons. Attached to the heart, it is the center of elemental activity inside the dragon's body. All blood flowing from the heart passes through this organ before going to the body. The draconis fundamentum charges the lungs with power for a dragon's breath weapon and also plays a major role in the dragon's highly efficient metabolism, which converts the vast majority of whatever the creature consumes into usable energy.</p>			
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">dragon, draconis, fundamentum</set>
			<set name="category">Monster Harvesting</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">300</set>
			<set name="weight" lb="6">6 lb.</set>
			<set name="stackable">true</set>
		</setters>
		<sheet alt="Draconis Fundamentum, Young Dragon" />
	</element>
